┃  mecatui — keys & features                                                                                                                        ┃
┃                                                                                                                                                   ┃
┃  Prompting                                                                                                                                        ┃
┃    enter                 send the prompt                                                                                                          ┃
┃    shift+enter           newline (also ctrl+j)                                                                                                    ┃
┃    /                     slash-command palette (built-ins always; workspace commands when enabled)                                                ┃
┃    @                     attach a file: image/audio inlines as media (when supported), else inlines text                                          ┃
┃    ctrl+v                paste a clipboard image as an attachment (when supported), else paste text                                               ┃
┃    ctrl+g                select all prompt text                                                                                                   ┃
┃    ctrl+y                copy the active prompt or conversation selection                                                                         ┃
┃    ctrl+u                clear the unsent prompt                                                                                                  ┃
┃    esc esc (physical)    enhanced key-event support required; first press is silent; key release then press within 500ms; repeats cannot confirm  ┃
┃                          clears staged attachments, large-paste content, and pending media; owners take precedence                                ┃
┃                          not remappable; universal alternative: ClearPrompt / ctrl+u                                                              ┃
┃  lines 1–14 of 64 · esc or ? close · ↑/↓ scroll · pgup/pgdn page · home/end jump                                                                  ┃
